WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.089
Conjunctions show links of time, reason, condition and contrast between sentence

00:00:05.089 --> 00:00:05.533
parts.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:09.865
Complete “I wanted to go, blank it rained.” Answer: but

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:15.446
Combine five pairs of sentences with because, although, since or unless as

00:00:15.446 --> 00:00:15.841
appropriate.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.919
Why it works: But signals contrast.
